const onlineAdvantageItems = [
  {
    title: 'You can start from your hostel, PG, campus, or workplace',
    body: 'Career counselling is available online in Pune and across India. That means the decision does not have to wait for a nearby office, a specific commute across the city, or one local slot opening up. The useful filter is whether the guidance improves the next move enough to matter.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Online guidance is often easier when family, exams, or work pressure are part of the issue',
    body: 'A large share of Pune\'s student population lives away from family, often across a state or country border. Working professionals juggle shift timings and long commutes across the city. Online support makes it easier to include family in the conversation when needed, and to join from wherever you already are instead of turning travel and logistics into another reason the harder decision keeps getting pushed forward.',
  },
  {
    title: 'The stronger comparison is not nearby versus far away - it is generic versus genuinely useful',
    body: 'A nearby or local-sounding option can still leave you with generic advice, degree-first pressure, or outdated paid assessments. The better filter is whether the guidance gives you stronger skill direction, proof-of-work thinking, clearer trade-offs, and a more practical next step for Pune, a bigger city, or a remote-first path.',
