  },
  {
    title: 'I have opinions from seniors, coaching classes, and hostel friend groups pulling in different directions',
    body: 'That is common in a city with as many students as Pune has. The problem is that most of that advice is based on what worked for someone else, not what fits your specific strengths, risk profile, and target. Real counselling works from your situation, not from whatever pattern is popular in your batch this year.',
  },
  {
    title: 'I am worried about wasting more time on the wrong path',
