---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <Nav activePage="career-guidance" />

  <section id="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <div class="orb orb-gold"></div>
      <div class="orb orb-teal"></div>
      <div class="grid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance">Career Counselling and Guidance</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href={BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.guidanceLocations}>Locations</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Career Counselling in Pune</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="pill hero-pill">
        <span class="pill-dot"></span>
        Practical support for students, freshers, and working professionals in Pune
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Career counselling in Pune
        <span class="gold-text"> for practical clarity and stronger next steps</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Pune draws students from across India and then hands many of them a genuine fork: stay on the automotive and manufacturing track around Pimpri-Chinchwad and Chakan, move into the IT and services track around Hinjewadi and Magarpatta, or head to Bangalore or Mumbai altogether.
        Most career advice available here is written for a single generic city. If you are at a real decision point - whether to stay or move, which track to build on, whether a degree is the right next step - the goal is getting clear before more time and money go the wrong way, and building the kind of high-value skill portfolio that unlocks high income opportunities and moves you toward earlier financial freedom.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-note">
        Guidance is delivered fully online in Pune and across India. You can start from your hostel, PG, campus, or workplace - no travel, no waiting for local availability.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-gold pulse">Get Student Career Counselling</a>
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-outline">Get Working Professional Career Counselling</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-support">
        The stronger filter is not only whether the search started with Pune. It is whether the guidance improves the next move enough to matter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="local-intent-fit"
    title="Why this decision already feels important"
    subtitle="You want support that feels easier to trust, easier to start, and more useful than generic advice - not another vague conversation."
    items={fitItems}
    variant="contrast"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={fitSummaryItems} variant="contrast" />
  </BofuListCardSection>

  <ContextualCta
    audience="mixed"
    title="If the Pune search already reflects a serious decision, move before more time goes into the wrong direction"
    body="Use this when you want stronger guidance now, not another round of delay while the decision keeps getting more expensive."
    studentHref="#plans"
    studentLabel="Get Student Career Counselling"
    professionalHref="#plans"
    professionalLabel="Get Working Professional Career Counselling"
  />

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="city-search-logic"
    title="What should get clearer before you commit harder"
    subtitle="The practical job of counselling is to improve direction, skill decisions, and next-step quality before confusion turns into another expensive wrong turn."
    items={localIntentItems}
    variant="decision"
  />

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="auto-vs-it-fork"
    title="Automotive or IT: the fork many Pune engineering graduates actually face"
    subtitle="Pune is unusual in having two genuinely strong career tracks side by side. Here is how they differ in practice, not just on paper."
    items={autoVsItItems}
    columns={2}
    variant="contrast"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={autoVsItSummaryItems} variant="neutral" />
  </BofuListCardSection>

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="pune-areas"
    title="Pune's main areas can shape the decision differently"
    subtitle="A useful local page should feel grounded in how people actually live, study, and work across Pune rather than pretending every user is comparing the same options from the same part of the city."
    items={puneAreaItems}
    variant="signal"
  />

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="city-page-vs-broader-guidance"
    title="Choose the stronger starting point for your situation"
    subtitle="For some people, local, Pune-specific support is the easiest way to start. For others, broader guidance across paths and skills is the better fit because the decision itself is already the bigger issue."
    items={cityDecisionItems}
    columns={2}
    variant="contrast"
  >
